Independently authored implementation of algorithms described by the YOLO26,
RLE and RealNVP research papers. See docs/provenance.md for references.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Ultralytics.

Research references:
Jocher et al., Ultralytics YOLO26: Unified Real-Time End-to-End Vision Models,
2026, https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.03748 (CC BY 4.0 paper).
Li et al., Human Pose Regression with Residual Log-likelihood Estimation,
2021, https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.11291.
Dinh et al., Density estimation using Real NVP,
2017, https://arxiv.org/abs/1605.08803.
Standard COCO joint-order and OKS sigma data: https://cocodataset.org/#keypoints-eval.
